;    0: TWdLink(count=3797, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\ホラーインダストリアル.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜山頂.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "200" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\市街地災害後2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "懐中電灯" "グラフィック\背景\特殊\懐中電灯.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "C" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>As I walked, my body gradually warmed up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even so, as it grew dark the air turned colder, and my white breath grew thicker still.<PG>
There was no light but the fires still burning here and there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The emergency power circuits seemed to be broken too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With the electrical systems dead, staying alive in this town will be hard.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd better get out of Motoki City soon.<PG>
For today, I'll go to <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>'s apartment building and rest there for the night.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no telling whether <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> is there, or whether the door is unlocked.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But with no family anywhere else, I have nowhere else to go.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, it might be easier to help myself to an empty room at one of the hotels around here, but...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll save that for if I can't get into <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>'s apartment.<PG>
Still, for a while now the road had felt slimy underfoot.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Until a little earlier it had been soft and fluffy with piled-up blossoms, but the feel of it was changing bit by bit.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I didn't watch my step, I might slip.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE追加\firewood-put1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There it was again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For a while now, something had been clattering whenever my foot struck it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I couldn't see it under the piled-up blossoms, but it was light, like tree branches.<PG>
And they weren't scattered about. They lay in clusters here and there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They were bunched into patches about 1 meter square, and my foot ran into one roughly every 20 meters.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It had been happening often ever since I entered the city center.<PG>
At first I hadn't paid it much mind, but the road was gradually turning from slimy to sticky.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then there were the things like tree branches I kept bumping into.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What on earth were they?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n11\r\n0\r\n1000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
I dug at the ground at my feet with my umbrella.<PG>
{DELETECG "000,懐中電灯" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Ugh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Normally I'd have covered my mouth with my hand, but I was holding the umbrella in both cuffed hands, so I couldn't.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What I had taken for tree branches―was this.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\警笛とざわめき_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\骸骨.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
White human bones, lit fitfully by the light of the fires.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As if the flesh had melted away, only the bones lay there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And spreading around them, a red, viscous liquid.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was it blood?<PG>
At last I understood.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not everyone had died indoors.<BR>
Everyone who died outside had been reduced to bare bones.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had they melted like this the moment they died?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or was there some other cause?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The difference between dying indoors and dying outdoors―<PG>
The only thing I could think of was whether they had touched these petals.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What if these cherry petals had the property of dissolving flesh and skin, leaving only bone?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So I thought, but that was impossible.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After all, they had no effect on me at all.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\walk-snow2早い.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\市街地災害後2.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "懐中電灯" "グラフィック\背景\特殊\懐中電灯.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "C" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
―I threw the umbrella away and hurried on.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was nearly pitch-dark now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Still walking, I took out the flashlight and lit the way ahead.<PG>
Frankly, why they died and why they melted doesn't matter.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have no time to think about such things anymore.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have to get away from this place. It's obviously bad news.<PG>
I want to get to <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>'s building quickly and find somewhere I can settle down.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At this point, I can't imagine <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> alive in her apartment.<PG>
The cherry blossoms squelched unpleasantly, holding back my every step.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n11\r\n0\r\n10000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
Motoki City, sinking into the dark with a creeping chill.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I felt like the hero of a zombie-apocalypse movie.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But there weren't any of the all-important zombies.<PG>
In movies like that, there's always a handcuff key conveniently lying around, or a gun lying around, or soldiers and researchers showing up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But in reality, it was a lone woman pushing 60, her backpack stolen from a convenience store and stuffed with daily necessities, walking along and breathing out white puffs.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No moviegoer would be the least bit moved by that.<PG>
I find myself gradually getting used to this situation.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's why I end up with silly fantasies like this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, if anything, I don't think I could hold on to myself without fantasies like that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's not that I'm getting used to it. The fear is closing in that I'm about to end up lying side by side with those skeletons.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\なつみマンション外観.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
I arrived in front of a strikingly new apartment building.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Naturally, there were no lights and no one passing by.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No doubt about it, this was the building <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> lived in.<PG>
The glass of the auto-lock door had shattered to pieces.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Convenient for a criminal like me to slip through.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The elevator was out, as expected.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Natsumi's apartment was 408, so I headed for the 4th floor.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\なつみマンション階段.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
As I climbed the stairs, the silence of the building overwhelmed me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because there were surely bodies lying inside it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This silence is the sound of death.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's because they're dead that this sound called 'silence' comes out.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\なつみマンション外廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―But it seemed even the dead had finally given up on me, and I reached room 408 without finding anything.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A nameplate that read 'Kogori'―no mistake.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I turned the doorknob―
{PAUSE ""}
and, as a matter of course, the resistance of a lock came through to my hand.<PG>
Now, what to do?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had no key, and when I looked around, there was no sign of one hidden anywhere.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, on a closer look―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\なつみマンションドア.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
It seemed to be a push-button code lock.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I pressed the right code, it should unlock.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Long ago, our family had decided to use one shared number for things like this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> was still using it―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have to try.<PG>
The number is Natsumi's birthday, July 29, Shiyo 783.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's entered backwards.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
9
{WAIT "300" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
2
{WAIT "300" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
7
{WAIT "300" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
0
{WAIT "300" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
3
{WAIT "300" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
8
{WAIT "300" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
7
{WAIT "300" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
0<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\鍵をかける.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The pleasant sound of the lock opening echoed along the outside walkway.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n11\r\n0\r\n1000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{PLAYSND "SE\屋上ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
The doorknob turned smoothly, and a darkness deeper than the walkway's seeped out through the gap in the door.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I stepped into the apartment as if I were being sucked into that gap.
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\なつみの部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
So this was where <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> lived now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was no sign of anyone in the neatly kept apartment.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> gone out, or...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was worried about <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> too, but first I had to warm up my frozen body.<PG>
There was a reflective kerosene heater, the kind you hardly ever see anymore.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
One of the things that sets off <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>'s April sickness is wind.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So, if I remember right, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> said that's why she uses a reflective heater, one that makes no wind.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With this, I can heat the room even without power.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\反射式ストーブ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "懐中電灯" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
When I lit the heater, a flame rose with a low, puttering roar and a smell of soot, and lit up the room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There seemed to be plenty of kerosene left, too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At least I wouldn't have to worry about staying warm tonight.<PG>
I looked all around the place, but <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> was nowhere to be seen.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There didn't seem to be a body either. Had she gone out after all?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Once I've rested a little, I'll go through the place and look for anything useful.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I've really sunk low, sneaking into my <STYLE ID="1">daughter</STYLE>'s apartment while she's out and rummaging through it.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\コンビニ弁当.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―While I had the chance, I ate the cold convenience-store boxed meal I'd packed in the backpack.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A strange state: hungry, yet with no appetite.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But it's exactly at times like this that you have to eat, or you'll just die in a ditch.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was my first food from the <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="しゃば">outside world</STYLE> in ages, but no feeling welled up in me at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I just mechanically put it in my mouth, worked my esophagus, and opened the cardia of my stomach.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
But why?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I tasted and smelled food like this, instead of feeling, sadness and emptiness welled up.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\夕焼け.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, sorry, it's convenience-store boxed meals today."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供喜びバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Ooh! This is what they call beef bowl, right!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"It's tasty with an egg in it. Want one?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
A few days before that letter came from <STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu</STYLE> in Megasawa.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That day, <STYLE ID="5">Ryoji-kun</STYLE> was away on a business trip.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was slacking off with all my might: <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> and me, the two of us, wolfing down convenience-store boxed meals.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
While the meals warmed in the microwave, I got the egg and some instant miso soup ready.<PG>
The supermarket I always went to had lost power or something, so I'd picked them up at a convenience store nearby on short notice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The convenience store was unusually crowded that day.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Supermarket customers like me had drifted over to the convenience store.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was no time to choose, so I just bought the first two my hands landed on.<PG>
With the store that packed, they weren't heating anyone's meals in their microwave.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供喜びバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Mmm! The beef bowl looks yummy!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Hey, hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, let's go halfsies on our meals!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, all right. That's a better idea."</STYLE><PG>
