{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If only that hadn't happened, by now I'd...!<PG>
By now... 
{PAUSE ""}
I might have been dead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For some reason, I managed to survive this disaster.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
